<title>USA: Coastal Physician names interim pres/CEO.</title>
<headline>Coastal Physician names interim pres/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DURHAM, N.C. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Physician Group Inc said Thursday it had named board member Henry Murphy as interim president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Murphy replaces Joseph Piemont, who resigned effective October 21.</p>
<p>A committee has been formed to find a permanent president and chief executive for the physician management company, Coastal said.</p>
